{"vid":"33JHHUat9D0","source":"33JHHUat9D0.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":3.9,"txt":"My name is Akbar Millender. I'm the"},{"t":5.6,"txt":"operations manager here and I've been"},{"t":8.1,"txt":"welding for 25 years. I started welding"},{"t":10.8,"txt":"high school. I took a vocational class"},{"t":12.9,"txt":"for 2 years."},{"t":15.9,"txt":"First thing we did was we learn how to"},{"t":18.2,"txt":"push the puddle because that's what"},{"t":19.9,"txt":"welding is. You have to be able to"},{"t":22.3,"txt":"manipulate the puddle and push it. We"},{"t":24.3,"txt":"would compete with each other, you know,"},{"t":26,"txt":"and I I end up getting pretty good."},{"t":27.7,"txt":"That's how I get this job."},{"t":29.5,"txt":"I won a welding competition and that"},{"t":31.9,"txt":"gave me the job here. I've been here for"},{"t":33.8,"txt":"for 22 years. At the time it probably"},{"t":35.9,"txt":"was only like 15 people here."},{"t":37.8,"txt":"The position that was open was grinder."},{"t":39.6,"txt":"That competitive spirit or whatever,"},{"t":41.6,"txt":"whatever I was going to do I just try to"},{"t":43.2,"txt":"be the best at it. So I went in the back"},{"t":44.7,"txt":"and I ground until he gave me a"},{"t":46.6,"txt":"opportunity"},{"t":48,"txt":"to weld."},{"t":49.2,"txt":"My mother always told me, you would"},{"t":51.2,"txt":"rather have it and not need it than need"},{"t":54.3,"txt":"it and not have it. Every job they gave"},{"t":56.3,"txt":"me I took. So I went from grinding"},{"t":60,"txt":"to production welding to painting"},{"t":62.9,"txt":"to shearing"},{"t":64.7,"txt":"to lasers"},{"t":66.9,"txt":"to robotic welding. So and what end up"},{"t":70.1,"txt":"happening is by me just having that type"},{"t":71.7,"txt":"of attitude, willing to learn"},{"t":73.7,"txt":"wanting to be the best at whatever and"},{"t":75,"txt":"now that's how I worked into the"},{"t":76.2,"txt":"position I'm in."},{"t":77.6,"txt":"It's a difference when you earn"},{"t":78.6,"txt":"something, you know, like it wasn't"},{"t":80.9,"txt":"given to me. I earned it the old"},{"t":82.8,"txt":"fashioned way. I didn't know nobody."},{"t":85.6,"txt":"Nobody didn't give me the position"},{"t":86.8,"txt":"because I was their cousin. No, I"},{"t":89.1,"txt":"actually worked my way from the ground"},{"t":90.7,"txt":"up. So if you looking to"},{"t":93,"txt":"get into a career in welding,"},{"t":95.6,"txt":"there's a lot of things that you can get"},{"t":97.4,"txt":"into. You can get into an apprenticeship"},{"t":100.6,"txt":"program, go to a vocational school, go"},{"t":103.6,"txt":"to a community college, go become an"},{"t":105.7,"txt":"engineer at a university. It's a trade,"},{"t":108.1,"txt":"you know, and can't nobody take that."},{"t":109.5,"txt":"It's going to be around forever."},{"t":111.8,"txt":"Life is very competitive, you know, no"},{"t":113.8,"txt":"matter what job you have anything in"},{"t":116.2,"txt":"life you you got to work to keep it. So,"},{"t":119.5,"txt":"uh I think my parents kind of dri- drove"},{"t":121.4,"txt":"that into me already. So, try to be the"},{"t":123.6,"txt":"best."}],"words":[{"t":3.88,"w":"My"},{"t":4,"w":"name"},{"t":4.2,"w":"is"},{"t":4.32,"w":"Akbar"},{"t":4.64,"w":"Millender."},{"t":5.36,"w":"I'm"},{"t":5.52,"w":"the"},{"t":5.6,"w":"operations"},{"t":6.16,"w":"manager"},{"t":6.6,"w":"here"},{"t":7.12,"w":"and"},{"t":7.52,"w":"I've"},{"t":7.6,"w":"been"},{"t":8.12,"w":"welding"},{"t":8.56,"w":"for"},{"t":8.68,"w":"25"},{"t":9.2,"w":"years."},{"t":10,"w":"I"},{"t":10.08,"w":"started"},{"t":10.44,"w":"welding"},{"t":10.76,"w":"high"},{"t":10.96,"w":"school."},{"t":11.48,"w":"I"},{"t":11.56,"w":"took"},{"t":11.76,"w":"a"},{"t":11.8,"w":"vocational"},{"t":12.44,"w":"class"},{"t":12.92,"w":"for"},{"t":13.32,"w":"2"},{"t":13.52,"w":"years."},{"t":15.92,"w":"First"},{"t":16.2,"w":"thing"},{"t":16.4,"w":"we"},{"t":16.52,"w":"did"},{"t":16.8,"w":"was"},{"t":17,"w":"we"},{"t":17.8,"w":"learn"},{"t":18.04,"w":"how"},{"t":